# Written by `pnpm -F @piorbit/desktop linux:assets` (scripts/make-linux-assets.mjs)
# from product.json, the two .tpl files beside this one, and package.json's
# version. The inputs are committed; the output is not, the same way
# build/icons/ is not.
#
# Four files land here: <appId>.metainfo.xml, <binary>.desktop,
# <binary>-setup.sh and launcher.sh. Every name in them comes from product.json
# (MX-T7), so a rename regenerates them under the new name and deletes the old
# ones rather than leaving a second dead menu entry behind.
#
# The rule lives here rather than in packages/desktop/.gitignore so that
# everything the Linux packaging owns stays in one directory.
generated/
